    "note": "136 E4 (DECISIONS 132, 136): a bank or card account statement exported as a table (a workbook or a CSV file), read by code without AI (jav/statement_table.py, jav/flow_statement_table.py). The fields, list fields, enumerations, required fields and checks are those of the bank statement packs (statement_cib, statement_erste); the schema and prompt files are theirs too and are never sent, as the code path calls no model. Not offered to detection (auto_detect false): an account's statement file is added to a work package from a chosen export."
